    {
      "bbox": [
        148,
        2171,
        1855,
        2331
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, operating city agencies have successfully delegated broad authority to their local District Officers enabling them to more effectively service the needs of the community and respond promptly to community concerns; and",
